y sharp edge while removing minimal metal, ensuring your tools have a prolonged lifespan.</p>\n'),(5421,291,'_sku','DM-CBN-8-600'),(5422,291,'_regular_price','89'),(5423,291,'total_sales','0'),(5424,291,'_tax_status','taxable'),(5425,291,'_tax_class','parent'),(5426,291,'_manage_stock','yes'),(5427,291,'_backorders','no'),(5428,291,'_sold_individually','no'),(5429,291,'_virtual','no'),(5430,291,'_downloadable','no'),(5431,291,'_download_limit','-1'),(5432,291,'_download_expiry','-1'),(5433,291,'_thumbnail_id','204'),(5434,291,'_stock','0'),(5435,291,'_stock_status','outofstock'),(5436,291,'_wc_average_rating','0'),(5437,291,'_wc_review_count','0'),(5438,291,'attribute_grit','600'),(5439,291,'_price','89'),(5440,291,'_product_version','8.8.5'),(5441,291,'_dmsphd_source_product_id','32'),(5442,291,'_amazon_asin','B0CY9JQB39'),(5443,291,'_amazon_listing_id','0317B37IUP4'),(5444,32,'_merged_into_variable_id','289'),(5445,33,'_dmsphd_original_sku','DM-CBN-8-80'),(5446,292,'_variation_description','<p>CBN grinding wheels, with their high hardness and superior grinding performance, are not only widely used in processing hard and brittle materials, such as hard alloys, molds, ceramics, glass, gemstones, semiconductors, etc What grit size should I choose for CBN wheels? If you frequently modify tools or occasionally create your own, opt for the 80-grit wheel as your coarse option. If you\'re not often involved in heavy grinding, choose a 180-grit wheel for sharpening and a 320-grit for fine-tuning your tools. This setup will produce an extremely sharp edge while removing minimal metal, ensuring your tools have a prolonged lifespan.</p>\n'),(5447,292,'_sku','DM-CBN-8-80'),(5448,292,'_regular_price','89'),(5449,292,'total_sales','0'),(5450,292,'_tax_status','taxable'),(5451,292,'_tax_class','parent'),(5452,292,'_manage_stock','yes'),(5453,292,'_backorders','no'),(5454,292,'_sold_individually','no'),(5455,292,'_virtual','no'),(5456,292,'_downloadable','no'),(5457,292,'_download