ign minimizes vibration for a smooth and consistent grind. Upgrade your sharpening game with this high-quality CBN grinding wheel and enjoy precise, reliable results every time.</p>\n'),(6290,326,'_sku','DM-TMK-8-1000'),(6291,326,'_regular_price','148'),(6292,326,'total_sales','0'),(6293,326,'_tax_status','taxable'),(6294,326,'_tax_class','parent'),(6295,326,'_manage_stock','yes'),(6296,326,'_backorders','no'),(6297,326,'_sold_individually','no'),(6298,326,'_virtual','no'),(6299,326,'_downloadable','no'),(6300,326,'_download_limit','-1'),(6301,326,'_download_expiry','-1'),(6302,326,'_thumbnail_id','219'),(6303,326,'_stock','0'),(6304,326,'_stock_status','outofstock'),(6305,326,'_wc_average_rating','0'),(6306,326,'_wc_review_count','0'),(6307,326,'attribute_grit','1000'),(6308,326,'_price','148'),(6309,326,'_product_version','8.8.5'),(6310,326,'_dmsphd_source_product_id','70'),(6311,326,'_amazon_asin','B0DQVHT5B9'),(6312,326,'_amazon_listing_id','1218B5UNBJ1'),(6313,70,'_merged_into_variable_id','325'),(6314,155,'_dmsphd_original_sku','DM-TMK-8-600'),(6315,327,'_variation_description','<p>Introducing the CBN grinding wheel, a powerful and efficient tool for sharpening your blades and tools. Crafted with precision, this 8-inch wheel features a 12mm arbor, ensuring a secure and stable fit on your grinding machine. The CBN (Cubic Boron Nitride) abrasive material is renowned for its exceptional hardness and wear resistance, making it an ideal choice for sharpening even the toughest materials. Whether you\'re a professional craftsman or an avid DIY enthusiast, this grinding wheel will help you achieve razor-sharp edges with ease. Its durable construction ensures long-lasting performance, while its balanced design minimizes vibration for a smooth and consistent grind. Upgrade your sharpening game with this high-quality CBN grinding wheel and enjoy precise, reliable results every time.</p>\n'),(6316,327,'_sku','DM-TMK-8-600'),(6317,327,'_regular_price','148'),(6318,327,'tot