tride (CBN), these inserts deliver outstanding performance when working with hard, abrasive materials like cast iron and hardened steel. Whether you\'re resurfacing engine components or tackling demanding industrial applications, our CBN inserts provide unparalleled durability and consistent results. Experience enhanced productivity, extended tool life, and superior surface finishes with these high-performance cutting solutions. Upgrade your metalworking arsenal today and unlock new levels of precision and efficiency.</p>\n'),(7372,369,'_sku','3J-7F5B-6U6K'),(7373,369,'_regular_price','39.8'),(7374,369,'total_sales','0'),(7375,369,'_tax_status','taxable'),(7376,369,'_tax_class','parent'),(7377,369,'_manage_stock','yes'),(7378,369,'_backorders','no'),(7379,369,'_sold_individually','no'),(7380,369,'_virtual','no'),(7381,369,'_downloadable','no'),(7382,369,'_download_limit','-1'),(7383,369,'_download_expiry','-1'),(7384,369,'_thumbnail_id','244'),(7385,369,'_stock','0'),(7386,369,'_stock_status','outofstock'),(7387,369,'_wc_average_rating','0'),(7388,369,'_wc_review_count','0'),(7389,369,'attribute_material','CBN'),(7390,369,'attribute_insert-size','RNGN0603'),(7391,369,'_price','39.8'),(7392,369,'_product_version','8.8.5'),(7393,369,'_dmsphd_source_product_id','111'),(7394,369,'_amazon_asin','B0DMM4QG24'),(7395,369,'_amazon_listing_id','1110B6RUFPN'),(7396,111,'_merged_into_variable_id','368'),(7397,118,'_dmsphd_original_sku','9P-1OAZ-DGXZ'),(7398,370,'_variation_description','<p>Polycrystalline Diamond (PCD) is a synthetic diamond. PCD Tipped Tools are the best to use in finishing and super fine cutting process at high speed for machining non-ferrous and Non-Metallic material, e.g. boring aluminum, turning aluminum-silicon alloy, milling copper alloys, etc. Also it can bore cast iron, groove wood (Fiberboard, hard wood), drill composites (Graphite-Epoxy, Carbon-Carbon Fiber, Fiberglass Plastic), countersink Ceramics (Sintered, Unsintered), ream Tungsten Carbide (Sintered, Unsintered), cutting Bakelite, Phenolic resins, polypropylene, pottery, microcrystalline glass, etc Polycrystalline Diamond (PCD) Tools – Precision Cutting &amp; Finishing Solutions Polycrystalline Diamond (PCD) is a high-performance synthetic diamond material, making PCD-tipped tools the ideal choice for high-speed finishing and ultra-precision machining of non-ferrous and non-metallic materials. These tools excel in applications such as: Boring &amp; turning: Aluminum, aluminum-silicon alloys Milling: Copper alloys Machining cast iron Woodworking: Grooving fiberboard, hardwood Composite drilling: Graphite-epoxy, carbon-carbon fiber, fiberglass-reinforced plastics Ceramic machining: Sintered/unsintered ceramics Tungsten carbide reaming: Sintered/unsintered grades Cutting plastics &amp; specialty materials: Bakelite, phenolic resins, polypropylene, pottery, microcrystalline glass, and more</p>\n'),(7399,370,'_sku','9P-1OAZ-DGXZ'),(7400,370,'_regular_price','18'),(7401,370,'total_sales','0'),(7402,370,'_tax_status','taxable'),(7403,370,'_tax_class','parent'),(7404,370,'_manage_stock','yes'),(7405,370,'_backorders','no'),(7406,370,'_sold_individually','no'),(7407,370,'_virtual','no'),(7408,370,'_downloadable','no'),(7409,370,'_download_limit','-1'),(7410,370,'_download_expiry','-1'),(7411,370,'_thumbnail_id','244'),(7412,370,'_stock','0'),(7413,370,'_stock_status','outofstock'),(7414,370,'_wc_average_rating','0'),(7415,370,'_wc_review_count','0'),(7416,370,'attribute_material','CBN'),(7417,370,'attribute_insert-size','RNGN1204'),(7418,370,'_price','18'),(7419,370,'_product_version','8.8.5'),(7420,370,'_dmsphd_source_product_id','118'),(7421,370,'_amazon_asin','B0DMM2CYYG'),(7422,370,'_amazon_listing_id','0518FZH97NK'),(7423,118,'_merged_into_variable_id','368'),(7424,173,'_dmsphd_original_sku','MV-V0U8-YF4H'),(7425,371,'_variation_description','<p>Elevate your machining capabilities with our CBN inserts, designed for turning, milling, and surfacing cylinder head