_sku','Aluminium-60'),(7622,379,'_variation_description','<p><b>Unleash Precision Grinding with our CBN Grinding Wheel</b><br /> <b>Introduction:</b><br /> <b>Elevate your grinding game with our premium CBN grinding wheel. Crafted with cutting-edge technology and precision engineering, this grinding wheel is designed to deliver unparalleled results for your sharpening and grinding needs.</b><br /> <b>Superior Material</b><br /> <b>Our CBN (Cubic Boron Nitride) grinding wheel is engineered to outperform traditional abrasive wheels. Its exceptional hardness and thermal conductivity ensure consistent, cool cutting throughout extended use.</b><br /> <b>Precision Grinding</b><br /> <b>Achieve razor-sharp edges and precise profiles effortlessly. The CBN abrasive excels in maintaining wheel shape and minimizing heat buildup, resulting in exceptional tool longevity.</b><br /> <b>Versatile Compatibility</b><br /> <b>Whether you\'re a professional machinist or a DIY enthusiast, our CBN grinding wheel suits a variety of applications. From high-speed steel to superalloys, this wheel handles it all.</b><br /> <b>Reduced Downtime</b><br /> <b>The efficient cutting action of our CBN wheel means less frequent wheel dressing and replacement. Spend more time grinding and less time maintaining your tools.</b><br /> <b>How to Use</b><br /> <b>Preparation: Ensure your grinder is in good working condition and securely mounted. Use appropriate safety gear, including eye protection and gloves.</b><br /> <b>Installation: Follow manufacturer guidelines to securely mount the CBN wheel onto your grinder. Double-check alignment and balance before operation.</b><br /> <b>Grinding Technique: Maintain a steady hand and consistent pressure while grinding. Let the wheel do the work and avoid excessive force.</b><br /> <b>Cooling: Periodically dip the tool being ground in water to prevent overheating. The CBN wheel\'s efficient heat dissipation minimizes the risk of burning your tools.</b></p>\n'),(7623,379,'_sku','Aluminium-60'),(7624,379,'_regular_price','99'),(7625,379,'total_sales','0'),(7626,379,'_tax_status','taxable'),(7627,379,'_tax_class','parent'),(7628,379,'_manage_stock','yes'),(7629,379,'_backorders','no'),(7630,379,'_sold_individually','no'),(7631,379,'_virtual','no'),(7632,379,'_downloadable','no'),(7633,379,'_download_limit','-1'),(7634,379,'_download_expiry','-1'),(7635,379,'_thumbnail_id','206'),(7636,379,'_stock','0'),(7637,379,'_stock_status','outofstock'),(7638,379,'_wc_average_rating','0'),(7639,379,'_wc_review_count','0'),(7640,379,'attribute_grit','60'),(7641,379,'_price','99'),(7642,379,'_product_version','8.8.5'),(7643,379,'_dmsphd_source_product_id','122'),(7644,379,'_amazon_asin','B0H41LNKGZ'),(7645,379,'_amazon_listing_id','0604HWJ2ZHU'),(7646,122,'_merged_into_variable_id','378'),(7647,170,'_dmsphd_original_sku','JC-KF0S-QB6A'),(7648,380,'_variation_description','<p><b>Unleash Precision Grinding with our CBN Grinding Wheel</b><br /> <b>Introduction:</b><br /> <b>Elevate your grinding game with our premium CBN grinding wheel. Crafted with cutting-edge technology and precision engineering, this grinding wheel is designed to deliver unparalleled results for your sharpening and grinding needs.</b><br /> <b>Superior Material</b><br /> <b>Our CBN (Cubic Boron Nitride) grinding wheel is engineered to outperform traditional abrasive wheels. Its exceptional hardness and thermal conductivity ensure consistent, cool cutting throughout extended use.</b><br /> <b>Precision Grinding</b><br /> <b>Achieve razor-sharp edges and precise profiles effortlessly. The CBN abrasive excels in maintaining wheel shape and minimizing heat buildup, resulting in exceptional tool longevity.</b><br /> <b>Versatile Compatibility</b><br /> <b>Whether you\'re a professional machinist or a DIY enthusiast, our CBN grinding wheel suits a variety of applications. From high-speed steel to superalloys, this wheel handles it all.</b><br /> <b>Reduced Downtime</b><br /> <b>The efficient cutting action of our CBN wheel means less frequent wheel dressing and replacement. Spend more time grinding and less time maintaining your tools.</b><br /> <b>How to Use</b><br /> <b>Preparation: Ensure your grinder is in good working condition and securely mounted. Use appropriate safety gear, including eye protection and gloves.</b><br /> <b>Installation: Follow manufacturer guidelines to securely mount the CBN wheel onto your grinder. Double-check alignment and balance before operation.</b><br /> <b>Grinding Technique: Maintain a steady hand and consistent pressure while grinding. Let the wheel do the work and avoid excessive force.</b><br /> <b>Cooling: Periodically dip the tool being ground in water to prevent overheating. The CBN wheel\'s efficient heat dissipation minimizes the risk of burning your tools.</b></p>\n'),(7649,380,'_sku','JC-KF0S-QB6A'),(7650,380,'_regular_price','99'),(7651,380,'total_sales','0'),(7652,380,'_tax_status','taxable'),(7653,380,'_tax_class','parent'),(7654,380,'_manage_stock','yes'),(7655,380,'_backorders','no'),(7656,380,'_sold_individually','no'),(7657,380,'_virtual','no'),(7658,380,'_downloadable','no'),(7659,380,'_download_limit','-1'),(7660,380,'_download_expiry','-1'),(7661,380,'_thumbnail_id','204'),(7662,380,'_stock','0'),(7663,380,'_stock_status','outofstock'),(7664,380,'_wc_average_rating','0'),(7665,380,'_wc_review_count','0'),(7666,380,'attribute_grit','220'),(7667,380,'_price','99'),(7668,380,'_product_version','8.8.5'),(7669,380,'_dmsphd_source_product_id','170'),(7670,380,'_amazon_asin','B0FC1L5NRL'),(7671,380,'_amazon_listing_id','0605FH8YR58'),(7672,170,'_merged_into_variable_id','378'),(7674,381,'total_sales','0'),(7675,381,'_tax_status','taxable'),(7676,381,'_tax_class',''),(7677,381,'_manage_stock','no'),(7678,381,'_backorders','no'),(7679,381,'_sold_individually','no'),(7680,381,'_virtual','no'),(7681,381,'_downloadable','no'),(7682,381,'_download_limit','-1'),(7683,381,'_download_expiry','-1'),(7