ng, but also light in weight and stable in operation. Ordinary grinding wheels are brittle in texture and are easily damaged during installation and use. 3.CBN grinding wheel has higher grinding efficiency Cubic boron nitride (CBN) is one of the hardest materials in the world, much harder than aluminum oxide.</p>\n','dmsphd CBN Chainsaw Sharpening 5-3/4\" Disk, 7/8\" Arbor, Thick for Sharpening Any Steel Chainsaw Chain','Why choose cbn grinding wheel? 1.CBN wheels are more durable A single cbn grinding wheel can sharpen over 1000 chainsaws and lasts a long time, whereas a normal grinding wheel can wear&hellip;','publish','open','closed','','dmsphd-cbn-chainsaw-sharpening-5-3-4-disk-7-8-arbor-thick-for-sharpening-any-steel-chainsaw-chain','','','2026-06-07 09:04:22','2026-06-07 09:04:22','',0,'http://localhost:8080/?product=dmsphd-cbn-chainsaw-sharpening-5-3-4-disk-7-8-arbor-thick-for-sharpening-any-steel-chainsaw-chain',0,'product','',0),(135,0,'2026-06-07 09:04:22','2026-06-07 09:04:22','<p>The Diamond Flat Lap Disc (6\" x 1/2\" Arbor) is a versatile and durable tool designed to handle challenging grinding and polishing tasks with precision. Featuring a diamond-coated surface, this flat lap wheel is ideal for working with tough materials like gemstones, ceramics, stone, and glass, delivering smooth and professional results. With a 6-inch diameter and a 1/2-inch arbor, this disc is compatible with most flat lap machines, making it a reliable choice for various workshop setups. Available in multiple grit levels, it accommodates a wide range of applications, from heavy material removal to delicate polishing. Built for longevity, this flat lap disc utilizes cutting-edge electroplating technology to firmly embed diamond particles, offering exceptional durability and reducing the need for frequent replacements. Whether you\'re a jeweler, glass artist, or hobbyist, this tool is an essential addition to your collection. Experience unmatched performance and precision – elev