king Tools, High Speed Steel Tools','This double-sided CBN grinding disk is designed for the WS3000 sharpening system, making it an ideal tool for sharpening woodworking and high-speed steel tools. Measuring 5-13/16 inches in diameter and 3/8 inch&hellip;','publish','open','closed','','dmsphd-double-sided-cbn-grinding-disk-grit-options-for-sharpening-woodworking-tools-high-speed-steel-tools','','','2026-06-07 10:11:52','2026-06-07 10:11:52','',0,'http://localhost:8080/?product=dmsphd-double-sided-cbn-grinding-disk-grit-options-for-sharpening-woodworking-tools-high-speed-steel-tools',0,'product','',0),(393,0,'2026-06-07 10:11:51','2026-06-07 10:11:51','','DMSPHD Double-Sided CBN Grinding Disk Grit Options for Sharpening Woodworking Tools, High Speed Steel Tools - 350/600','Grit: 350/600','publish','closed','closed','','dmsphd-double-sided-cbn-grinding-disk-grit-options-for-sharpening-woodworking-tools-high-speed-steel-tools-350-600','','','2026-06-07 10:11:51','2026-06-07 10:11:51','',392,'http://localhost:8080/?post_type=product_variation&p=393',0,'product_variation','',0),(394,0,'2026-06-07 10:11:51','2026-06-07 10:11:51','','DMSPHD Double-Sided CBN Grinding Disk Grit Options for Sharpening Woodworking Tools, High Speed Steel Tools - 80/180','Grit: 80/180','publish','closed','closed','','dmsphd-double-sided-cbn-grinding-disk-grit-options-for-sharpening-woodworking-tools-high-speed-steel-tools-80-180','','','2026-06-07 10:11:51','2026-06-07 10:11:51','',392,'http://localhost:8080/?post_type=product_variation&p=394',0,'product_variation','',0);
